  m_text: Earth has officially hit 451 degrees. Scientists say we had 'plenty of warnings' and 'one job.' The oceans are a hot tub. Lake Lag has boiled, which is impressive, because it was already empty. The Moon is now the only place with decent weather. You have thirty seconds to grab what you can. Good luck, and stay hydrated.
